                                        <header class=the-economy>
                                            <h2>
                                                <a href=/the-economy/banking-and-financial-markets/fintech-innovations-in-banking-fintech-partnership-and-default-rate-on-bank-loans>
                                                    Fintech Innovations in Banking: Fintech Partnership and Default Rate on Bank Loans
                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                                    <div class="article-authors-date">
                                                        <p class="article-author-by">by</p>
                                                        <ul class="authors">
<li class="author"><a href="/our-people/julapa-jagtiani" itemprop="author">Julapa Jagtiani</a>,&nbsp;</li><li class="author"><span itemprop="author">Catharine Lemieux</span>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;</li><li class="author"><span itemprop="author">Brandon Goldstein</span></li>                                                        </ul>
                                                        <p class="article-date">July 2025</p>
                                                    </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <p class="article-excerpt">WP 25-21 – We explore whether banks could leverage data and technology to expand their customer base without taking on more credit risk. Previous studies have not explored the impact of fintech partnerships on the quality of banks’ loan portfolios. </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div data-content-type="working paper" class="card card-article the-economy">
                                <div class="card-content">
                                    <div class="eyebrow">
                                            <p class="topic-title">
                                                <a href="/the-economy/banking-and-financial-markets">Banking and Financial Markets</a>
                                            </p>
                                        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-working-paper">
                                            Working Paper
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <header class=the-economy>
                                            <h2>
                                                <a href=/the-economy/banking-and-financial-markets/the-role-of-bank-fintech-partnerships-in-creating-a-more-inclusive-banking-system>
                                                    The Role of Bank-Fintech Partnerships in Creating a More Inclusive Banking System
                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                                    <div class="article-authors-date">
                                                        <p class="article-author-by">by</p>
                                                        <ul class="authors">
<li class="author"><span itemprop="author">Alan Chernoff</span>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;</li><li class="author"><a href="/our-people/julapa-jagtiani" itemprop="author">Julapa Jagtiani</a></li>                                                        </ul>
                                                        <p class="article-date">October 2023</p>
                                                    </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <p class="article-excerpt">WP 23-21 – Fintech firms are often viewed as competing with banks. Instead, more recently, there has been growth in partnership and collaboration between fintech firms and banks.</p>
